@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@customerId = 1
@productId1 = 1
@productId2 = 2
@orderId = 1

### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### Create customer
POST {{baseUrl}}/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ravi Kumar",
  "email": "ravi@example.com",
  "phone": "+91 98765 43210",
  "deliveryAddress": "12 Park Road, Pune, Maharashtra 411001"
}

### Create product 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "KEY-100",
  "name": "Mechanical Keyboard",
  "description": "Quiet switches",
  "price": 4999.00,
  "stockQuantity": 10
}

### Create product 2
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "MOUSE-100",
  "name": "Wireless Mouse",
  "description": "USB-C charging",
  "price": 1999.00,
  "stockQuantity": 20
}

### Search products with bounded pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?search=key&page=0&size=20&sort=name&direction=asc

### Place order - duplicate product IDs are rejected
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": {{customerId}},
  "items": [
    { "productId": {{productId1}}, "quantity": 1 },
    { "productId": {{productId2}}, "quantity": 2 }
  ]
}

### Get order details
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}

### List customer orders by status
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders?customerId={{customerId}}&status=CREATED&page=0&size=20&sort=createdAt&direction=desc

### Confirm
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/confirm

### Ship
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/ship

### Deliver
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/deliver

### Cancel a different CREATED or CONFIRMED order
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel

### Validation error example
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "",
  "name": "",
  "price": 0,
  "stockQuantity": -1
}
